        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend. Upgrade. Rise higher.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Spire: Tower Defense is a fantasy roguelite where you defend your tower against waves of enemies. Spend gold on temporary boosts and collect gems to unlock permanent upgrades. When your tower falls, the run ends. Your permanent upgrades carry over to the next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend gold during a run to increase your damage, fire faster, or give your tower more health.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/0931456946a2d3730ea7c668fd6b17fc.poster.avif?t=1789055640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/0931456946a2d3730ea7c668fd6b17fc.webm?t=1789055640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/0931456946a2d3730ea7c668fd6b17fc.mp4?t=1789055640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep the gems you earn, even when your tower falls, and use them to prepare for another run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/21cd6a6a66209f94d12d59010210e562.poster.avif?t=1789055640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/21cd6a6a66209f94d12d59010210e562.webm?t=1789055640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/21cd6a6a66209f94d12d59010210e562.mp4?t=1789055640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in permanent upgrades to make your tower stronger with every attempt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/1ab27dc849d57980cd6310e0d874206e.poster.avif?t=1789055640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/1ab27dc849d57980cd6310e0d874206e.webm?t=1789055640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/1ab27dc849d57980cd6310e0d874206e.mp4?t=1789055640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend. Upgrade. Rise higher.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Spire: Tower Defense is a fantasy roguelite where you defend your tower against waves of enemies. Spend gold on temporary boosts and collect gems to unlock permanent upgrades. When your tower falls, the run ends. Your permanent upgrades carry over to the next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spend gold during a run to increase your damage, fire faster, or give your tower more health.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/0931456946a2d3730ea7c668fd6b17fc.poster.avif?t=1789055640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/0931456946a2d3730ea7c668fd6b17fc.webm?t=1789055640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/0931456946a2d3730ea7c668fd6b17fc.mp4?t=1789055640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep the gems you earn, even when your tower falls, and use them to prepare for another run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/21cd6a6a66209f94d12d59010210e562.poster.avif?t=1789055640\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985770/extras/21cd6a6a66209f94d12d59010210e562.webm?t=1789055640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea